  "observations": [
    "Inspected current H01-H12 whole-body and face images, H01/H03 rear views, weapons and representative costumes. Source and meaningful geometry/animation regressions verify head/body proportions, jointed hands/fingers, clothing topology and distinct weapon geometry.",
    "Actual geometry/material measurements cover 24 non-original weapon skins and 48 costumes. The 46-image gallery includes representative cosmetic views, not separate photographs of every cosmetic or every angle.",
    "Inspected all seven biomes and current terrain, foliage, water and portal implementation. GPU reflection probes and page/shader-error checks passed; these do not certify Android performance."
  ],
