  "remainingArtWork": [
    "Full final fidelity and image/motion review of all heroes, soul weapons, cosmetics, bosses and biomes under ART10/AR01 remain open; shared procedural anatomy and portraits do not establish AAA quality.",
    "Wolf/kirin previews crop the feet. Biome architecture/materials remain repetitive and the secret realm needs final cosmic staging; current captures do not establish the complete art direction.",
    "ART10 and HUD09 additionally require physical Android art/touch review. No physical device is connected.",
    "The fourth boss and Tien-khi statistics/durability remain reserved for official source data, as requested by the user."
